shi-019-xietiao:p003:m0050","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝朓。"},{"start":62,"end":64,"surface":"沈約","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0062","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作沈約。"},{"start":65,"end":66,"surface":"約","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0065","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作沈約。"},{"start":74,"end":76,"surface":"范曄","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0074","person_id":"bxh_oop_5ic","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作范曄。"},{"start":80,"end":83,"surface":"朱修之","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0080","person_id":"j6y_10h_eso","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作朱修之。"},{"start":87,"end":90,"surface":"蔡興宗","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0087","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作蔡興宗。"},{"start":122,"end":125,"surface":"劉安西","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:u0122","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"沈約所舉以官稱人之前例；安西不唯一，個人名未核定。"},{"start":143,"end":146,"surface":"孫興公","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0143","person_id":"9c1_b3c_cb7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作孫綽。"},{"start":147,"end":149,"surface":"孔覬","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0147","person_id":"vjg_m4c_ev5","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作孔覬〔宋，字思遠〕。"},{"start":219,"end":220,"surface":"朓","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0219","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝朓。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":1531762,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_start":6453,"raw_end